  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"556\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"554\">Clinical Utility:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"732\">\n<p data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"626\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Assesses <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"606\">Riboflavin (Vitamin B2) deficiency</strong>, which may lead to:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"732\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"673\">\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"673\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Angular stomatitis, glossitis, cheilosis</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"732\">\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"732\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Seborrheic dermatitis, anemia, peripheral neuropathy</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"851\">\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"851\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Monitors <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"766\">nutritional status</strong>, especially in malnourished individuals, alcoholics, or inborn errors of metabolism.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
